WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Drag a file in Finder and hold Shift.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.500
Drop on JPG in the conversion wheel.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.500
A new JPG is ready. The original stays safe.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Open Fine-tune → Crop Image.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:33.800
Choose 1:1 and drag to select the area to keep.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:39.000
Press Return to save a cropped copy.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The cropped output appears in Freshly made and Finder.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.500
Drag the video and hold Command to open Tools.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:56.500
Choose Trim Video.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.500
Space plays or pauses the preview.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:08.000
Drag the In handle to set the beginning.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Drag the Out handle to set the end.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.500
Play the selected range to check the cut.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:29.400
Save a fresh trimmed copy.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:34.900
The 12-second source becomes a 7.07-second copy.
